owner acts:
  - remove dsh-plugin-upgrader [desktop]: dsh plugin --profile desktop remove -- dsh-plugin-upgrader
      record only: first-run never writes a non-fleet profile; the owner runs this exact command by hand if they agree
  - classify the installed fleet profile [fleet]
      the fleet profile (fleet) is fleet-owned and not readable by this uid; run the same first-run command as the fleet user to inventory it
  - enter provider credentials [fleet]: dsh-fleet first-run --credentials
      interactive terminal only; values are never echoed, logged or written by this tool outside the fleet credential store (or a 0600 staging file the authorised install step places)

